      <data key="d2">cb-0279</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRANSNATIONAL CELEBRITY MARRIAGES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Transnational Celebrity Marriages refers to the topic of Y. Nakamura's research involving Tadao Takashima and Evelyn Herbert Webb."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0279</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THE IMPACT OF INTERCULTURAL MARRIAGES ON JAPANESE IDENTITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Impact of Intercultural Marriages on Japanese Identity is the topic of K. Yamada's research."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0279</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FUTURE GENERATIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Future generations refer to the next generation of people who will explore international relationships."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0279</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JAPANESE CELEBRITIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Japanese celebrities are individuals who are part of the Japanese entertainment industry and are known internationally."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0279</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INTERNATIONAL RELATIONSHIPS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"International relationships refer to connections and interactions between people from different countries."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0279</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TADAO TAKASHIMA AND EVELYN HERBERT WEBB&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tadao Takashima and Evelyn Herbert Webb represent a specific example of a transnational marriage."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0279</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRANSNATIONAL MARRIAGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Transnational marriage refers to a marriage between individuals from different countries."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0279</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INTERRACIAL MARRIAGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Interracial marriage is a type of transnational marriage where individuals from different racial backgrounds marry."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0279</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JAPANESE IDENTITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Japanese identity refers to the cultural and national identity of Japanese people."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0279</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INTERCULTURAL MARRIAGES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Intercultural marriages involve individuals from different cultural backgrounds marrying each other."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0279</data>
    </node>
